    id: "9",
    slug: "boost-your-business-through-ict-event-in-kilinochchi-and-mullaitivu",
    title: "boost-your-business-through-ict-event-in-kilinochchi-and-mullaitivu",
    excerpt: "WUSC Sri Lanka together with Northern Chamber of Information Technology (NCIT) organized “Boost Your Business through ICT” event for Micro, Small and ...",
    content: "<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">WUSC Sri Lanka together with Northern Chamber of Information Technology (NCIT) organized “Boost Your Business through ICT” event for Micro, Small and Medium size Enterprises (MSMEs) on November 17th 2018 in Kilinochchi and  on 2nd December 2018 in Mullaitivu </p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Participants  gained knowledge on:</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">· How to start a business</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">· Improving your current business potential</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">· Introduce new technologies and ideas to your&nbsp;<br>business</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">· Advertise your products or services and new trends&nbsp;<br>in the Industry</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">The purpose of this event was to support Micro, Small and Medium size Enterprises to improve the productivity by introducing new Information and Communication Technologies into their business.</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Facilitators from Northern Chamber of Information Technology NCIT were presented and clearly explained about growth of technology and how small, micro and medium enterprises can use to improve their businesses at “Boost Your Business” in Kilinochchi&nbsp;and Mullaitivu</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/groups/190201704676007/permalink/794786394217532/\">Killinochchi Event</a><br><a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/NCITLK/posts/2755812217978287\">Mullaitivu Event</a></p>\n\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t</div><!-- .entry-content .clear -->",
