    excerpt: "We are in the process to purchase following Items for NCIT Business Incubation Center. We are seeking for&nbsp; Bids from Vendors in Northern Province...",
    content: "<p style=\"text-align: left;\">We are in the process to purchase following Items for NCIT Business Incubation Center. We are seeking for&nbsp; Bids from Vendors in Northern Province . please go through the attached&nbsp; bid documents and send to NCIT in sealed Cover .We have extended the closing date until <strong>2nd of June 2018</strong> and bid welcomed from all (Not limited to Members). Please Hand over your Bids in Sealed Cover at NCIT Office before <strong>2nd of June 2018 4PM</strong>. Bids will be opened on 2nd June Saturday Evening 4.30 PM</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">For More information Contact Venu(0773049886) or Thava (0777563213)</p>\n<ol>\n<li>Stage Podium- 01</li>\n<li>Security camera system</li>\n<li>SOUND SYSTEM</li>\n<li>Multimedia Projector- 01</li>\n<li>Projector Ceiling Mount -01</li>\n<li>Desktop Computer System set&nbsp; -01</li>\n<li>UPS -01</li>\n<li>Laptop Computer 01</li>\n<li>Laser Printer 01</li>\n</ol>\n<p>Download Bid Documents <a href=\"/wp-content/uploads/2018/05/NCIT_Business_Incubation_Ceter_25050218.zip\">Here</a></p>\n<p>-Financial Director, 26.05.2018 –</p>\n\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t</div><!-- .entry-content .clear -->",
