    slug: "meeting-with-deputy-chief-of-mission-robert-b-hilton",
    title: "meeting-with-deputy-chief-of-mission-robert-b-hilton",
    excerpt: "U.S. Embassy Colombo, Sri Lanka Deputy Chief of Mission Robert B. Hilton learned about NCIT and Yarl IT hub efforts to build tech &amp; Entrepreneursh...",
    content: "<p>U.S. Embassy Colombo, Sri Lanka Deputy Chief of Mission Robert B. Hilton learned about NCIT and Yarl IT hub efforts to build tech &amp; Entrepreneurship eco systems to support innovation in Northern Province. Chairman Thavaruban From NCIT and Ramesh from YarlITHub were participated.</p>\n<p><a href=\"/wp-content/uploads/2017/11/20506960_2361755690717277_5057883640454215908_o.jpg\"><img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"aligncenter size-full wp-image-360\" src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2017/11/20506960_2361755690717277_5057883640454215908_o.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1200\" height=\"883\"></a> <a href=\"/wp-content/uploads/2017/11/20615765_2361755687383944_2144386486913576483_o.jpg\"><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"aligncenter size-full wp-image-361\" src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2017/11/20615765_2361755687383944_2144386486913576483_o.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1200\" height=\"760\"></a></p>\n<p>Meeting were held on&nbsp;01.08.2017 @ Jetwing Hotel Jaffna</p>\n\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t</div><!-- .entry-content .clear -->",
