    id: "25",
    slug: "ncit-agm-held-and-board-of-directors-elected-for-2018-2019",
    title: "ncit-agm-held-and-board-of-directors-elected-for-2018-2019",
    excerpt: "Annual General Meeting of NCIT held in NCIT Business Incubation center Training Hall&nbsp; on 23.02.2019.It was First AGM after NCIT cooperated in Jul...",
    content: "<p>Annual General Meeting of NCIT held in NCIT Business Incubation center Training Hall&nbsp; on 23.02.2019.It was First AGM after NCIT cooperated in July 2017 .General body elected Board of Directors for 2018/19&nbsp; Administrative Year.</p>\n<p>Following Members Elected for Board</p>\n<p>1 .Mr.Thangarajah Thavaruban [CEO,Speed IT net ]<br>\n2. Mr.Sivapathasuntharam Sivaskaran [Director, MCS IT Campus]<br>\n3. Mr.Kanesh Venugoban [Director,College of ICT]<br>\n4. Mr.Sharmmhik Yogarajah [CEO,BNS]<br>\n5. Mr.Kamal Raj [Director, IT Platform]<br>\n6.Mr.Sathvithan [CEO,Sun Micro System ]<br>\n7.Ms.J.Jerusha[ CEO,eZ Booking ]<br>\n8.Mr.Subramaniam Theivamynthan [CEO,Iconic Corder]<br>\n9.Mr.Nadarajah Shanmugarajah [Apps Lanka ]</p>\n<p>There after Board members elected Office Bearers as follow</p>\n<p><strong>Chairman &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;:</strong>&nbsp;Thavaruban T&nbsp;[CEO,Speed IT net ]<br>\n<strong>Vice Chairman &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;:</strong>&nbsp;Sivaskaran S&nbsp;[Director, MCS IT Campus]<br>\n<strong>Financial Director &nbsp; :</strong>&nbsp;Venugopan&nbsp;K&nbsp;[Director,College of ICT]</p>\n<p>Company Secretary and Auditor also selected</p>\n<p><strong>Company Secretary:</strong>&nbsp; Abaya Law firm (Pvt) Ltd<br>\n<strong>Auditors</strong>: JA Partners</p>\n<p><a href=\"/wp-content/uploads/2019/02/IMG-237eb6aaa3c735023fa4b2d9a465c7f9-V.jpg\"><img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"aligncenter size-full wp-image-701\" src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2019/02/IMG-237eb6aaa3c735023fa4b2d9a465c7f9-V.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1280\" height=\"960\"></a> <a href=\"/wp-content/uploads/2019/02/IMG-f85b2a8d2e04c0d073b99ccadfcccdec-V.jpg\"><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"aligncenter size-full wp-image-702\" src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2019/02/IMG-f85b2a8d2e04c0d073b99ccadfcccdec-V.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1280\" height=\"960\"></a></p>\n\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t</div><!-- .entry-content .clear -->",
