    content: "<p>Basic requirements to start a business venture organized by Regional office-Central bank with NCT on&nbsp; 28.9.2019 @Jaffna Public Library Conference</p>\n<p><a href=\"/wp-content/uploads/2020/01/71033132_3001908993368607_7168636807452557312_o.jpg\"><img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"aligncenter size-full wp-image-756\" src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2020/01/71033132_3001908993368607_7168636807452557312_o.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1323\" height=\"1890\"></a> <a href=\"/wp-content/uploads/2020/01/69440672_3010681749157998_9042675547166998528_n.jpg\"><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"aligncenter size-full wp-image-757\" src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2020/01/69440672_3010681749157998_9042675547166998528_n.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"720\" height=\"540\"></a> <a href=\"/wp-content/uploads/2020/01/71819433_3010681722491334_4176129717037957120_n.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"aligncenter size-full wp-image-758\" src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2020/01/71819433_3010681722491334_4176129717037957120_n.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"960\" height=\"720\"></a> <a href=\"/wp-content/uploads/2020/01/71093172_3010681679158005_5261778002131288064_n.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"aligncenter size-full wp-image-759\" src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2020/01/71093172_3010681679158005_5261778002131288064_n.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"960\" height=\"720\"></a></p>\n\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t</div><!-- .entry-content .clear -->",
