    title: "social-media-for-business",
    excerpt: "There was workshop held on 12.09.2016 in jaffna TCT Hall to educate students about social media those who completed the A/L examination.It’s about the...",
    content: "<p>There was workshop held on 12.09.2016 in jaffna TCT Hall to educate students about social media those who completed the A/L examination.It’s about the beneficial side of social media and the ways to define career path towards #SocialMedia The workshop is organized by HigherStudy.lk in association with Birdfather.&nbsp;Northern Chamber of Information Technology supported as Community partner. There was around 150 Students was participated.</p>\n<div id=\"gallery-1\" class=\"gallery galleryid-125 gallery-columns-3 gallery-size-medium\"><figure class=\"gallery-item\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallery-icon landscape\">\n\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https://www.ncit.lk/social-media-for-business/14249758_1068363813284500_9064136118583302174_o/\"><img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"200\" src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2016/09/14249758_1068363813284500_9064136118583302174_o-300x200.jpg\" class=\"attachment-medium size-medium\" alt=\"\"></a>\n\t\t\t</div></figure><figure class=\"gallery-item\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallery-icon landscape\">\n\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https://www.ncit.lk/social-media-for-business/14258164_1068364156617799_4731251383690940681_o/\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"200\" src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2016/09/14258164_1068364156617799_4731251383690940681_o-300x200.jpg\" class=\"attachment-medium size-medium\" alt=\"\"></a>\n\t\t\t</div></figure><figure class=\"gallery-item\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallery-icon landscape\">\n\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https://www.ncit.lk/social-media-for-business/14258308_1068373969950151_629687284300677088_o/\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"133\" src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2016/09/14258308_1068373969950151_629687284300677088_o-300x133.jpg\" class=\"attachment-medium size-medium\" alt=\"\"></a>\n\t\t\t</div></figure><figure class=\"gallery-item\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallery-icon landscape\">\n\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https://www.ncit.lk/social-media-for-business/14289907_1068367579950790_2262329036231941577_o/\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"145\" src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2016/09/14289907_1068367579950790_2262329036231941577_o-300x145.jpg\" class=\"attachment-medium size-medium\" alt=\"\"></a>\n\t\t\t</div></figure><figure class=\"gallery-item\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallery-icon landscape\">\n\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https://www.ncit.lk/social-media-for-business/14311469_1068364799951068_6644478326150774807_o/\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"101\" src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2016/09/14311469_1068364799951068_6644478326150774807_o-300x101.jpg\" class=\"attachment-medium size-medium\" alt=\"\"></a>\n\t\t\t</div></figure><figure class=\"gallery-item\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallery-icon landscape\">\n\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https://www.ncit.lk/social-media-for-business/14324138_1068370716617143_442036288741820580_o/\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"200\" src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2016/09/14324138_1068370716617143_442036288741820580_o-300x200.jpg\" class=\"attachment-medium size-medium\" alt=\"\"></a>\n\t\t\t</div></figure><figure class=\"gallery-item\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallery-icon landscape\">\n\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https://www.ncit.lk/social-media-for-business/14352043_1068368449950703_3606268112236741114_o/\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"200\" src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2016/09/14352043_1068368449950703_3606268112236741114_o-300x200.jpg\" class=\"attachment-medium size-medium\" alt=\"\"></a>\n\t\t\t</div></figure><figure class=\"gallery-item\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallery-icon landscape\">\n\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https://www.ncit.lk/social-media-for-business/14361329_1068366806617534_8409551825240663076_o/\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"200\" src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2016/09/14361329_1068366806617534_8409551825240663076_o-300x200.jpg\" class=\"attachment-medium size-medium\" alt=\"\"></a>\n\t\t\t</div></figure><figure class=\"gallery-item\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallery-icon landscape\">\n\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https://www.ncit.lk/social-media-for-business/14372321_1068364069951141_322832781046788718_o/\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"200\" src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2016/09/14372321_1068364069951141_322832781046788718_o-300x200.jpg\" class=\"attachment-medium size-medium\" alt=\"\"></a>\n\t\t\t</div></figure><figure class=\"gallery-item\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallery-icon landscape\">\n\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https://www.ncit.lk/social-media-for-business/14372401_1068366549950893_8860478147891489481_o/\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"200\" src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2016/09/14372401_1068366549950893_8860478147891489481_o-300x200.jpg\" class=\"attachment-medium size-medium\" alt=\"\"></a>\n\t\t\t</div></figure>\n\t\t</div>\n\n\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t</div><!-- .entry-content .clear -->",
