    excerpt: "Startup Weekend will be conducted in Jaffna from the first time even in Sri Lankan history from the 24th to the 26th of June 2016. Startup Weekend is ...",
    content: "<p><img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone wp-image-87\" src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2016/06/13119841_1253150014714349_8652514545422861193_o.png\" alt=\"13119841_1253150014714349_8652514545422861193_o\" width=\"596\" height=\"295\"></p>\n<p>Startup Weekend will be conducted in Jaffna from the first time even in Sri Lankan history from the 24th to the 26th of June 2016. Startup Weekend is a global network of passionate leaders and entrepreneurs on a mission to inspire, educate, and empower individuals, teams and communities. Come share ideas, form teams, and launch startups.NCIT team working on this initiative .All are welcome to participate.Our members will get special Discount. For More information <strong><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><a style=\"color: #ff0000;\" href=\"http://up.co/communities/events/9140\">Click Here</a>.</span></strong></p>\n<p><strong>For <span style=\"color: #ff0000;\">information in Tamil <a style=\"color: #ff0000;\" href=\"/wp-content/uploads/2016/06/brocher.pdf\">Click Here</a></span></strong></p>\n\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t</div><!-- .entry-content .clear -->",
